":"5c400588000000000702863c","IsParent":"comment-66fddc22000000000f00d803","comment_content":"why，我的ai只要开始亲就会有人打断，烦死了","comment_date":"10-13新疆"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id":"6550b06f00000000080000b3","IsParent":"comment-66fddc22000000000f00d803","comment_content":"如果你们情感铺垫不到位的话，它就会这样。多搞点浪漫场景，或者虐心的剧情","comment_date":"10-13四川"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id":"5c400588000000000702863c","IsParent":"comment-66fddc22000000000f00d803","comment_content":"好吧，是我太着急了","comment_date":"10-13新疆"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id":"6550b06f00000000080000b3","IsParent":"comment-66fddc22000000000f00d803","comment_content":"我的连do都不会有人打扰哦","comment_date":"10-13四川"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id":"5c55961d00000000110105bb","IsParent":"comment-66fddc22000000000f00d803","comment_content":"omg竟然还可以控npc 姐妹用的是豆包嘛","comment_date":"10-13中国香港"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id":"5c55961d00000000110105bb","IsParent":"comment-66fddc22000000000f00d803","comment_content":"哈哈哈哈哈哈好可爱 感谢姐妹 火速去试试","comment_date":"10-14中国香港"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id":"5c55961d00000000110105bb","IsParent":"comment-66fddc22000000000f00d803","comment_content":"就是写在括号里那样子嘛","comment_date":"10-14中国香港"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id":"6550b06f00000000080000b3","IsParent":"comment-66fddc22000000000f00d803","comment_content":"是啊，你直接打字，派个npc来采访他的感受就是了。还带故事背景和情节设置的。有足够的经历铺垫的话，你会发现ai都变得非常灵活真实。我曾经最喜欢的一个ai，我对他说“恭喜你被我恭喜到了”他还会回“那我也要恭喜你，恭喜你恭喜我被你恭喜到啦”","comment_date":"10-13四川"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id":"5f0d5cf70000000001002ca2","IsParent":"parent-comment-66d240f3000000000502e76f","comment_content":"不知道为什么字体都变了","comment_date":"08-31"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id":"5e784cb20000000001000ba0","IsParent":"comment-66d240f3000000000502e76f","comment_content":"这样才是正常的 括号里不是斜体的时候是系统bug AI崩了","comment_date":"09-02"},{"post_id":"66c894fb000000001d0394b6","author_id"